# ZL Equalizer 2 for WebCLAP

ZLEqualizer by ZL Audio (zsliu98), a dynamic equalizer with match EQ, ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official
ZL Audio release.

- ZLEqualizer: https://github.com/ZL-Audio/ZLEqualizer (commit 3ce598e, after version 1.4.1)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-zl-equalizer.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

Changes in this port (`patches/zl-equalizer-webclap.patch`): the editor's analyzer and curve loops, which run on
threads upstream, run one pass per repaint on the editor's thread, and the processor builds without its editor.
The sidechain is the bundle's second input. Presets and UI settings the editor saves live in the page's memory and
are gone when it reloads.

